.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_NUMBER 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_number \- resolve an MPQ filename to its file number.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__file_number("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        const char     *" "filename",
.BI "        uint32_t       *" "number"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__file_number\fP() to resolve a filename using the archive
hash table. The lookup does not require a listfile.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The function resolves \fIfilename\fP and
stores its file number in \fInumber\fP.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, zero is returned and the file number is stored in \fInumber\fP.
On error, one of the following constants is returned.
.TP
.B LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST
The file does not exist in the archive.
